    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35202" root="قحب" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَحْبَةٌ</span></b>  fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَحْبٌ</span> [q. v.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <i>A cough:</i>
[and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُحَابٌ</span> used as a simple subst.:] thus in
the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ قَحْبَةٌ</span> [<i>In him is</i> (i. e. <i>he has</i>) <i>a
cough</i>]: (K, TA:) and thus in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالدَّابَّةِ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَحْبَةٌ</span> [<i>In the beast,</i> or <i>horse</i> or <i>the like, is a
cough</i>]. (TA.)

